insert into reviewer_private.concept_test_items(skill,prompt,options,correct,explanation) values
('grammar','The inventory of replacement parts ___ ready for inspection. Choose the verb.',
 '["are","is"]',1,'Inventory is the singular head of the subject. Of replacement parts modifies inventory. Use is to agree with the head, even though parts is plural.'),
('data-interpretation','A library issued 80 cards in April and 100 in May. Which comparison follows from both figures?',
 '["May issues were 25% higher than April issues.","Twenty more residents visited the library in May."]',0,'The change is 20 cards on a base of 80, or one fourth. Card issues do not tell us the change in total visits or identify unique residents.'),
('filipino','“Sa halip na tahasang tumanggi, ipinagpaliban niya ang pagsagot.” Ano ang ibig sabihin ng tahasang?',
 '["Tuwiran","Palihim"]',0,'Tuwiran ang ibig sabihin ng tahasan. Inihahambing rito ang tuwirang pagtanggi sa pagpapaliban ng sagot. Ang palihim ay walang kaugnayan sa kung gaano kadirekta ang tugon.'),
('clerical','Two files have surnames Ramos and Ramirez. Under ordinary letter-by-letter filing, which comes first?',
 '["Ramos","Ramirez"]',1,'Compare R-a-m, then the next letters. The i in Ramirez comes before the o in Ramos. A shorter surname only comes first on that basis if it is a complete prefix of the other.'),
('verbal-antonyms','The guidelines are flexible. Which word best expresses the opposite idea in this context?',
 '["Rigid","Durable"]',0,'Flexible guidelines can adapt. Rigid guidelines are fixed and resist adjustment. Durable concerns how long something lasts, so it is a different dimension.'),
('analytical-letter-patterns','Using positions A = 1 through Z = 26, complete B, E, I, N, … .',
 '["S","T"]',1,'The positions are 2, 5, 9 and 14, with gaps of 3, 4 and 5. Add 6 to get 20, or T. S would repeat the 5-position gap.'),
('filipino-usage','Alin ang wastong pagkakabuo?',
 '["Nagsalita siya nang malinaw.","Nagsalita siya ng malinaw."]',0,'Ang malinaw ay nagsasabi kung paano siya nagsalita, kaya nang ang pananda. Ang ng ay angkop, halimbawa, sa “Nagbasa siya ng liham,” kung saan ang liham ang binasa.'),
('clerical-indexing','The filing rule says to index personal names by surname, then given name. Which key follows the rule for Elena Cruz?',
 '["Elena, Cruz","Cruz, Elena"]',1,'Cruz is the surname and comes first under this rule. Putting Elena first would sort this file with given names beginning with E.'),
('verbal-main-idea','The office first tested online booking at one branch. Missed appointments fell there, so the office extended booking to the other branches. Which statement captures the main idea?',
 '["A successful trial led the office to expand online booking.","One branch used online booking first."]',0,'The first choice links the trial, its result and the expansion. The second is accurate but leaves out why the trial matters to the rest of the paragraph.'),
('verbal-pronouns','Jules spoke to Ana after the meeting. Jules said the minutes were incomplete. Which rewrite keeps the speaker clear?',
 '["Jules spoke to Ana after the meeting and said the minutes were incomplete.","Jules spoke to Ana after the meeting. They said the minutes were incomplete."]',0,'The first version makes Jules the subject of both spoke and said. In the second, they may be read as singular or as referring to both people.'),
('filipino-synonyms','“Masinop sa pagtatala ng gastos ang ingat-yaman.” Alin ang pinakamalapit sa masinop?',
 '["Maingat","Mapagbigay"]',0,'Sa pagtatala, ang masinop ay maingat at maayos sa paghawak ng detalye. Ang mapagbigay ay tumutukoy sa kahandaang magbigay, na ibang katangian.'),
('filipino-antonyms','“Pansamantala ang iskedyul na ito.” Ano ang pinakamalapit na kasalungat ng pansamantala?',
 '["Madalian","Permanente"]',1,'Ang pansamantala ay para sa limitadong panahon. Ang permanente ay nilalayong manatili. Ang madalian ay nagsasaad ng bilis o pagkaapurahan, hindi ng tagal.'),
('analytical-assumptions','An office proposes moving a queue outdoors to reduce the number of people in its waiting room during peak hours. What must be true for the proposal to work as stated?',
 '["Some people who would wait indoors can instead wait outdoors.","Everyone who visits the office prefers to wait outdoors."]',0,'If nobody can move their wait outdoors, indoor occupancy cannot fall through this plan. Universal preference is unnecessary because moving some people could reduce occupancy.'),
('clerical-numeric','File these identifiers using their numeric values, not their written length. Which comes first: 0089 or 102?',
 '["102","0089"]',1,'The value of 0089 is 89. Since 89 is less than 102, 0089 comes first. Leading zeroes are part of the written identifier and should still be retained on the file.'),
('clerical-transcription','Copy the reference exactly: QA-0317-B6. Which entry matches?',
 '["QA-0317-B6","QA-0371-B6"]',0,'Compare the groups on either side of the hyphens. Both entries match QA and B6, but only 0317 retains the original order of 1 and 7.')
on conflict (skill) do nothing;
